  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요.&#160;</p><p>처음으로 수업자료를 올려봅니다.</p><p>마침 수능 주간 원격수업이라 자료를 찾던 중</p><p><a href=\"https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"The Lesson of the Kaibab\" data-og-description=\"Introduction: The environment may be altered by forces within the biotic community, as well as by relationships between organisms and the physical environment. The carrying capacity of an ecosystem is the maximum number of organisms that an area can suppor\" data-og-host=\"www.biologycorner.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html\" data-og-url=\"https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cfOxBf/hyQA9Epnk7/KafgGJdGmWkhCoHzfBebB1/img.jpg?width=503&amp;height=338&amp;face=0_0_503_338\"><a href=\"https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.biologycorner.com/worksheets/kaibab.html\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cfOxBf/hyQA9Epnk7/KafgGJdGmWkhCoHzfBebB1/img.jpg?width=503&amp;height=338&amp;face=0_0_503_338)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">The Lesson of the Kaibab</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Introduction: The environment may be altered by forces within the biotic community, as well as by relationships between organisms and the physical environment. The carrying capacity of an ecosystem is the maximum number of organisms that an area can suppor</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.biologycorner.com</p></div></a></div><p>위 자료를 보고 내용이 좋다고 생각되어 구글 스프레드시트로 옮겨서 활동지 만들어보았습니다.</p><p>아래 링크입니다.&#160;</p><p>피드백도 함께 해주심 더 발전시켜 나감 좋을 것 같습니다. 감사합니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1EtSKKkR_Pe7DCJVO2rtSC